{"id":"u-7e1b8a8d-88c3-4c5d-a7e1-45dc0918f79a","src":"community","title":"Muscle gain/Fat loss - 5 day","author":"mike C.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/yb1dPU-muscle-gainfat-loss","desc":"Muscle gain + Fat loss\n\nDay 6-7: Rest or Light Cardio\n\nFocus on recovery or low-intensity cardio like walking or cycling.\n\nNutrition Tips\n\t1.\tCaloric Deficit: Aim for a slight deficit (300-500 calories per day) to lose fat while retaining muscle.\n\t2.\tHigh Protein Intake: 1.6-2.2g protein per kilogram of body weight.\n\t3.\tHealthy Fats and Carbs: Include essential fats (avocado, nuts) and complex carbs (oats, rice) to fuel workouts.\n\t4.\tStay Hydrated: Drink plenty of water, especially during workouts.\n\nCardio\n\t•\tInclude 2-3 sessions of high-intensity interval training (HIIT) or low-intensity steady state (LISS) cardio per week to aid fat loss without impacting recovery.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Women's","Muscle","Strength","Athletics"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":55,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-07T16:58:10.995Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push(Chest,Shoulders,Triceps)","Pull (Back/Biceps)","Legs","Upper (Hypertrophy)","Lower (Hypertrophy)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Shrug (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Concentration Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ex"